WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:03.100
SPUC?

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.100
The sci-fi character?

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.840
Who's talking about sci-fi?

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:14.480
Spiritual Power Usage Contest.
In short, SPUC.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:17.050
Must you shorten it like that?

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.650
So, what's that all about?

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:25.490
It's a festival held since ancient times for spiritual power users.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:28.360
There aren't many restrictions on who can participate.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:33.200
Anyone confident in their strength can participate.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.130
What?

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.430
I know about this!

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:38.800
If you win, you will get respect from everyone.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:39.970
I see.

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.210
You will participate as the representative of our family.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:47.380
Make the world know about the
Kawahira Family Inukami Users!

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.810
Wow, you're the representative!

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:52.920
H-hang on for a sec.
What about Kaoru?

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:55.220
Isn't it usually his kind of thing?

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:58.920
For reasons we cannot tell,
Master Kaoru is unable to participate.

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:01.420
So I'm just a substitute, huh?

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:05.660
In exchange, we have been ordered to assist you.

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:09.900
We will do anything to help.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.170
A-anything?

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.300
Anything...

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.170
You're all so cute.

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:18.710
Master Keita.

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:21.640
I'm here too, you know.

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:24.650
Master Keita is mine.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:28.420
You can't be serious. He is mine.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:29.550
What did you say?

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:30.690
You wanna fight?

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.160
Stop it, both of you.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:37.260
I can't watch you fight because of me.

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:39.630
Master Keita!

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.880
I'll do it!
I'll definitely win!

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:07.490
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:10.860
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:17.800
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:34.250
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:41.360
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:48.000
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:55.800
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:02:55.800 --> 00:03:00.510
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:04.310
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:07.480
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:13.360
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:17.590
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:20.860
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:27.540
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:33.010
Beg to be Exhausted!

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.380
There's no way Keita will lose.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:38.880
I agree.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:41.620
But we must always be prepared.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.160
What's wrong, Keita?

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:49.230
I accepted it just like that...

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.030
but I'm gonna represent the Kawahira family, right?

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:57.400
If I lose, I will hurt the Kawahira family name.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.770
If that happens, Kaoru's going to be in trouble, too.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:05.010
You all won't be able to face him, right?

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.780
In any case, I must win.

00:04:08.380 --> 00:04:10.550
It's quite the pressure.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:14.320
That's why,
I'm not that excited about it.

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:23.760
Let's all support Master Keita so that he can win.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:24.630
Yes.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.730
That's how it is, so...

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.800
Let's have fun for today!

00:04:30.800 --> 00:04:32.030
What?

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:34.040
Come on, relax.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.100
Don't touch me!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.940
Evil Fire!

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:44.450
What have you two done?

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:47.920
It's all right.
Let's just enjoy ourselves.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:59.160
So it was the usual
Master Keita after all.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:03.670
Well, if he's this energetic, he should be fine tomorrow.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.300
He'll win.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:06.400
You think?

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:07.700
You're right.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:12.610
Well then, we will be going.
See you at the venue tomorrow.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:14.380
Yeah, good night.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.260
I'm hungry.

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:32.830
Where does that good smell come from?

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:38.100
Excuse me.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:43.170
Oh, this is it! Yum, yum.

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:56.090
Keita, hurry and wake up.
We're gonna be late.

00:05:56.550 --> 00:05:57.720
Geez.

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:06.430
Oh Keita, you never learn.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:09.670
If you don't get off,
I'm gonna burn you.

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:11.330
Geez.

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:16.140
Keita. I said wake up!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.540
Keita.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:19.540
I said, Keita!

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.210
Keita!

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:25.480
Keita! Keita! Keita! Keita!

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.450
Keita!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.990
Keita?

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:37.290
Are you all right? Keita!

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:48.300
Everyone, the time has come.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.880
It's the Spiritual Power
Usage Contest.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:58.610
More specifically, today is the 256th contest!

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:02.820
Taking the role of commentator as well as judge is myself,

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:06.290
Tomekichi the traveling cat.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:10.130
If you see any odd Buddha statues, please inform me.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:14.130
Now then, let the first match begin.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:20.170
Invisible Human, well, woman, versus Macho Loach will begin shortly.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:29.080
What's wrong?

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.350
No!

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.620
She lost her will to fight.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:39.190
Invisible Human, well, woman, seems to have lost against her own shyness.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:42.360
Macho Loach is the winner.

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:48.130
Macho Loach will immediately wait for his next opponent, Keita Kawahira.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.540
Family head, what are those?

00:07:53.870 --> 00:07:57.310
If this were horse racing, these would be betting tickets.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:07:59.810
I'm betting big with these.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.280
I'm counting on you, Keita.

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:06.680
Keita

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:10.690
He was already like this, this morning.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.420
He's got no energy left.

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:17.430
There is no chance of winning like this.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:21.160
Do you have any idea what caused this?

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:23.430
Is something wrong?

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:25.400
Nothing!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:29.670
I heard that the family head bet a huge sum of money on Master Keita.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:32.140
She has high hopes for him.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:34.840
It's gonna be okay, he'll win...

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:35.910
How?

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.650
It's none of your business.

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.180
But it totally is!

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:42.990
Master Keita's defeat is also Master Kaoru's defeat.

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:46.190
I cannot let things be as is!

00:08:46.190 --> 00:08:47.890
That is true.

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:50.760
We already promised last night.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:55.100
We would work together to support Master Keita, right?

00:08:55.100 --> 00:08:58.470
It's gonna be okay.
I'll do something about it.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:01.770
Yeah, Yoko should handle this.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.670
Keita is Yoko's master after all.
Right, Igusa?

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.510
Huh? Y-yes...

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.480
Umm, I...

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.010
Mr. Keita, you're up.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:13.920
What's wrong?

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:17.220
Nothing! We'll bring him right away.

00:09:21.020 --> 00:09:22.560
I'm letting go, okay?

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.260
Begin!

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:34.440
Are they waiting for their opponent to make a move?

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:36.840
Neither of them are moving.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.710
Still not moving.

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:45.610
What's wrong, Master Keita?
Please do this seriously.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:50.990
Loach...

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.690
H-he's down!

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:57.260
It seems Macho Loach has dried up!

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.760
Therefore, Kawahira is the winner!

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:05.970
What's up with that act?
What's wrong with Keita?

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:08.140
I'm so nervous.

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.710
This is bad.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.470
This is really bad.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.310
How is it Keita? Does it feel cooler?

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:21.020
That's right. Water. Teleport!

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:27.760
Sorry, I'll bring a towel.

00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:38.770
He's not energetic at all.
Could it be...

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.700
Don't touch me!

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:44.010
Maybe I shouldn't have done that.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:47.980
What if he can't win because of me?

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:54.250
Because of this huge idiot, our family has been disgraced forever.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.620
You're so violent!

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:58.520
- I can't believe you!
- Leave!

00:10:58.950 --> 00:11:04.030
Everybody will blame me, and maybe they'll throw me out.

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:04.330
Abandoned Dog

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.700
After that...

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:15.140
I picked you up.
Don't you forget your gratitude to me.

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:19.040
Whine, woof woof!

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.080
No!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.210
How can I make him bounce back?

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:26.750
There's no other way than that... right?

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:30.020
You wanted to touch my back, right?

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:32.050
I'll let you touch it.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:35.190
I really don't want you to, but...

00:11:35.190 --> 00:11:37.760
You better feel better!

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.500
I just can't!

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.370
Sorry, again...

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:50.040
Hey, are you okay?

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.210
What's wrong?

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:56.680
No, no, it's not my fault!

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.050
What?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.550
"Inukami!"

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:04.050
Woof woof!

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.760
"Inukami!"

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:09.060
Woof woof.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:15.060
The next match is Keita Kawahira versus Thin Ittan-Momen!

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:18.570
It's said that you can barely feel anything when touching him.

00:12:18.870 --> 00:12:21.300
What tactics could Keita have up his sleeve?

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.070
Hey, Keita!

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:26.070
Cloth Filtering!

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:33.320
It seems that Thin Ittan-Momen can no longer continue the match.

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:36.280
Therefore, Kawahira has won his second match!

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:39.620
Mr. Keita!
Please be serious about this!

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:41.620
Err, sorry about that.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.760
What should I do?

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:50.830
Maybe Master Keita is like that because of me.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:54.070
If they find out...

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:55.640
100 whippings for you!

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:58.440
This is bad.

00:13:02.740 --> 00:13:05.450
Master Keita, I will confess.

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:08.980
The chocolate you ate that day...

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.890
I picked it up off the ground.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:15.590
I just wanted the holographic card that came with it.

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:17.160
All right!

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.890
I'm sorry.

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:19.960
About what?

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:22.960
Yoko! Please give this to Master Keita.

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:27.540
It's the Golden Great Pill Bug.
It has a defense power of 1,500.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:29.500
Well then, I'll be off.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:49.560
Kawahira is the winner.

00:13:56.600 --> 00:14:00.270
Umm, it's because of that after all, isn't it?

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:06.240
I was so surprised when
I met you at the city recently.

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:08.540
You're fired, Igusa.

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.950
We have to burn these things!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.750
I can't live on anymore...

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.720
I'm just not good with men.

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:22.190
I wasn't avoiding you.

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:28.060
The only thing I can do right now...

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.570
is this.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.100
Let's make a miracle!

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:39.570
All right, here we go.
Pipiruma panpuru kurukururin!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.480
Master Keita, get better!

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.780
What are you doing?

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:51.820
Nobody else has ever seen me in this!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.590
This is...!

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:56.190
Tomekichi!

00:14:56.190 --> 00:14:59.030
I knew he wasn't the usual Mr. Keita.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.930
Is he all right?

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:04.930
He's all right.
I'll definitely make him win.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:07.200
Umm, that's not what I mean.

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:14.240
The final match is up soon, but I'm worried about Master Keita.

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:15.580
I'll go look.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.580
I'll come with.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.920
Does that feel good, Keita?

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:24.020
You're gonna put your finger there?

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:34.100
How is it, Keita?

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.260
Tomohane, don't look!

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:38.530
W-what are you doing!?

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.600
I'm massaging his foot.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:46.010
If you press here...

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.610
See, it looks like it feels good, right?

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:51.750
I guess so...

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.620
I guess s-so...

00:15:53.850 --> 00:15:56.950
But he's still not getting any better.

00:15:57.150 --> 00:15:59.520
What's left is a heart massage...

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.520
And probably mouth-to-mouth CPR...

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.030
There's no need!

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:04.990
Really?

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:06.830
But the book said so.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.860
What book?

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:11.000
"Love-Love Massage for Couples..."

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:14.000
Calm down.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:16.240
We've heard all about it from Sendan.

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:21.140
We brought you our special fruit that we grew with our hearts!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:23.510
No matter how ill they are, with just one bite...

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:25.480
They'll be instantly healthy.

00:16:25.850 --> 00:16:27.220
Hyperactively healthy!

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:29.480
That's, somehow...

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:30.990
It seems to be alive.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.260
- That's because...
- ...it's hyperactive!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.460
Hyperactive?

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:37.160
Totally!

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.760
Fine, why not.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:43.430
Keita, eat this and get better!

00:16:47.140 --> 00:16:48.270
Keita!

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.170
Begin observation!

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.310
It's going well.

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:57.950
Better than we expected.

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:02.980
Stop, stop it!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.390
Are you trying to kill this boy!?

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:11.630
You're a Hunger God, aren't you?

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:12.630
Hunger God?

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:16.130
They're nasty demons that normally live in the mountains.

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:20.900
Sometimes, they feed on people and absorb their life forces.

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:24.870
So Keita was all weak because of it?

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:26.470
That's right.

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:30.750
He doesn't just have strong spiritual power, but great energy.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:33.150
That attracted me.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:36.180
Is that so?
So it wasn't because of me!

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.920
- You've just wasted...
- ...our precious experiment!

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:40.960
I'm so relieved.

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:43.460
Wait, give me back my holo card!

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:44.730
What?

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:45.730
Dunno...

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.430
Whatever.

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:51.030
But I'll never forgive you for making Keita suffer!

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.500
Bring it on.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:57.340
I've absorbed his life force and
I'm hyper actively energetic!

00:17:58.040 --> 00:17:59.340
Evil Fire!

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:04.110
Purification Flash.
Manifestation x4, Crimson!

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:07.350
Evil Blaze!

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:18.690
Please forgive me!
I'll give back the remaining energy!

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:21.130
Then I'll spare your life.

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:23.100
So hurry up and make Keita better.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:24.330
Right away, ma'am.

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:26.330
I'm home.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.500
See you.

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:31.140
Keita!

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:33.680
Keita!

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.380
I'm so glad.

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:39.380
Yoko? Was I...

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:43.420
Come on, Keita.
The final match is up.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.590
Now, it's finally the final match!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.560
It's Keita Kawahira the Inukami User versus...

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:55.100
...Fancy Rabbit, the dark horse.

00:18:56.300 --> 00:18:58.330
It seems like he's no longer possessed.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:00.970
But of course, that was nothing.

00:19:00.970 --> 00:19:03.710
Now victory is definitely in Master Keita's hands.

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:07.980
Master Keita, good luck!

00:19:08.410 --> 00:19:11.680
Right, leave it to me.
They've fallen for me.

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:14.920
Let the final match begin!

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.590
I don't have any grudge against you.

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:21.890
I simply must win.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:25.230
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:26.260
Frog...

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:47.680
F-Fancy Rabbit is the winner.

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:54.920
Family head...

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.760
That Keita...

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:58.330
He lost.

00:19:58.330 --> 00:19:59.960
I can't believe this.

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.560
He should've won!

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:04.030
- As expected...
- ...of Master Keita.

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.240
Are you all right?

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.040
Yoko.

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:11.040
What is it?

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:14.480
Did I have breakfast?

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:16.380
Huh?

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:22.020
Aloha! Well, does it fit me?

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:25.220
Keita really is a wonderful grandson.

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:26.990
Maybe I'll bring him souvenirs.

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:33.030
Family head, weren't you betting on Master Keita to win?

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:35.260
Who ever said such a thing?

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:37.930
So you bet that he would lose?

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:40.840
Whether you win or lose is all about luck, that's all.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:43.540
What?

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:48.010
Good grief, you really are...

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:51.050
Mr. Loser, tea please.

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:53.350
Yes yes, right away.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:55.020
Loser, bring me some snacks.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.880
Yes, yes.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.520
Bring me a tissue!

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.950
I always use them.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:01.590
- Seconds!
- Yes!

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:03.830
Hey Loser, over here.

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:09.060
Geez, why do I have to do this?

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:11.070
I spilled it again!

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:12.230
Give me a break!

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:13.130
Keita.

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:15.100
- Be right there!
- Master Keita!

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:19.370
Let's make a miracle!

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:22.180
Everybody's memory, begone!

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:43.130
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:48.500
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:53.680
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:58.950
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:02.050
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:04.490
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:07.020
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.320 --> 00:22:10.860
<i>and nothing makes any sense.</i>

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.630
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:16.400
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.140
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.140 --> 00:22:26.810
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:35.720
<i>Let's go! Let's go! Fight!</i>

00:22:35.720 --> 00:22:38.390
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:42.060
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:54.100
Inukami!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.040
See you!

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:55.900
Next episode preview

00:22:55.900 --> 00:23:01.810
When engulfed by endless despair, people stop walking and stand still.

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:04.850
When dominated by despair they can't win against,

00:23:04.850 --> 00:23:08.180
they stop crying and put on fake smiles.

00:23:09.120 --> 00:23:15.060
The girl's song freezes the moon, carrying her cruel fate.

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:17.290
Next on Inukami!

00:23:18.060 --> 00:23:21.130
"Hear my Song of Death!"

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:24.500
"Despair" is a disease that leads to death.
